{'symbol': 'COST', 'date': '2023-05-25 16:15:00', 'title': 'COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION REPORTS THIRD QUARTER AND YEAR-TO-DATE OPERATING RESULTS FOR FISCAL 2023', 'text': 'ISSAQUAH, WASH., MAY 25, 2023 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- COSTCO WHOLESALE CORPORATION (“COSTCO” OR THE “COMPANY”) (NASDAQ: COST) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS OPERATING RESULTS FOR THE THIRD QUARTER (TWELVE WEEKS) AND THE FIRST 36 WEEKS OF FISCAL 2023, ENDED MAY 7, 2023.'}